{"slug":"w-d-e","ar":"و د ع","total":4,"core":"leaving; depositing","forms":[{"ar":"مُسْتَوْدَع","kind":"passive participle","form":10,"count":2,"gloss":"place of deposit, repository","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":98,"p":8,"ar":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَنشَأَكُم","مِّن","نَّفْسٍ","وَٰحِدَةٍ","فَمُسْتَقَرٌّ","وَمُسْتَوْدَعٌ ۗ","قَدْ","فَصَّلْنَا","ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","لِقَوْمٍ","يَفْقَهُونَ"],"en":"And it is He who produced you from one soul and [gave you] a place of dwelling and of storage. We have detailed the signs for a people who understand"}},{"ar":"دَعْ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":1,"gloss":"to leave, disregard","word":null,"ex":{"s":33,"a":48,"p":5,"ar":["وَلَا","تُطِعِ","ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","وَدَعْ","أَذَىٰهُمْ","وَتَوَكَّلْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ ۚ","وَكَفَىٰ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَكِيلًا"],"en":"And do not obey the disbelievers and the hypocrites but do not harm them, and rely upon Allah. And sufficient is Allah as Disposer of affairs"}},{"ar":"وَدَّعَ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"to forsake, bid farewell","word":null,"ex":{"s":93,"a":3,"p":2,"ar":["مَا","وَدَّعَكَ","رَبُّكَ","وَمَا","قَلَىٰ"],"en":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muhammad], nor has He detested [you]"}}],"surahs":[[6,1],[11,1],[33,1],[93,1]]}